sketches of Chocolate, by the way. Chocolate is not, in any scene,
large or comperable in height to a human. He is a stuffy, and is
"animate when he needs to be". Also, the imagination thing sounds
really campy, and the whole "shouting at the screen" and such seems
almost intolerably so. Perhaps we can tone down the campiness in
general? Ground it a little bit more in reality while still being
exciting and interesting, yeah?

